Name: Sandboxed zlib for Blink
Short Name: zlib_sandboxed
URL: N/A (built from //third_party/zlib)
Version: Same as //third_party/zlib
Date: 2025-11-18
Update Mechanism: Manual rebuild when zlib updates
License: Zlib (same as //third_party/zlib)
License File: //third_party/zlib/LICENSE
Shipped: No
Security Critical: yes
License Android Compatible: yes

Description:
This directory contains a sandboxed version of zlib using RLBox's wasm2c
backend. This is part of a research project and not intended for production use.

This provides a backend for the usage of RLBox to sandbox zlib usage in Blink's
CompressionStream/DecompressionStream APIs.

Usage:
This library is used exclusively by:
- //third_party/blink/renderer/modules/compression

